# NOTE: dist/ is intentionally NOT ignored. The riselynk.com config that the
# active-site seam points at lives at dist/site/riselynk/site.config.ts and MUST
# be committed for the build. (The upstream site-engine repo ignores dist/ because
# there it is hydrator output; here it is the committed, load-bearing site config.)
